"                    its validation will trigger its automatic payment, and you will then only have to generate a\n"
"                    direct debit file containing this operation and send it to your bank to effectively get paid."
msgstr ""
"ເມື່ອໃບເກັບເງິນຖືກສ້າງຂຶ້ນໃນ Odoo ສໍາລັບລູກຄ້າທີ່ມີໜັງສືຍິນຍອມທີ່ໃຊ້ງານໄດ້ໃນວັນທີຂອງໃບເກັບເງິນ,\n"
